# BNB Greenfield Reputation Storage Configuration Example
#
# This file demonstrates how to configure the agent0 SDK to use
# BNB Greenfield for reputation data storage instead of IPFS.

# ===== Reputation Storage Backend Selection =====
# Options: "ipfs" (default) or "greenfield"
# Uncomment to enable Greenfield storage:
# REPUTATION_BACKEND=greenfield

# ===== Greenfield Storage Configuration =====
# Required when REPUTATION_BACKEND=greenfield

# Storage Provider endpoint (without https://)
# Testnet example:
# GREENFIELD_SP_HOST=gnfd-testnet-sp1.bnbchain.org
# Mainnet example:
# GREENFIELD_SP_HOST=gnfd-sp1.bnbchain.org

# Bucket name for storing reputation data
# GREENFIELD_BUCKET=my-reputation-bucket

# Private key for signing requests (hex format, with or without 0x prefix)
# WARNING: Keep this secret! Never commit to version control!
# GREENFIELD_PRIVATE_KEY=0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef

# Transaction hash from CreateObject operation
# This is required for PutObject operations
# You need to create the object on-chain first and get the txn hash
# GREENFIELD_TXN_HASH=0xabcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890

# Optional: Content-Type for uploaded objects
# Default: application/octet-stream
# GREENFIELD_CONTENT_TYPE=application/json

# Optional: Request timeout in seconds
# Default: 30
# GREENFIELD_TIMEOUT=60

# ===== IPFS Configuration (fallback/default) =====
# Used when REPUTATION_BACKEND=ipfs or not set

# IPFS node URL (for local IPFS node)
# IPFS_API_URL=http://localhost:5001

# Pinata configuration (alternative to local IPFS)
# PINATA_ENABLED=true
# PINATA_JWT=your_pinata_jwt_token_here

# Filecoin Pin configuration (alternative to local IPFS)
# FILECOIN_PIN_ENABLED=true
# FILECOIN_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# ===== Network Information =====
# Greenfield Testnet
# - Chain ID: 5600 (Greenfield Testnet)
# - RPC: https://gnfd-testnet-fullnode-tendermint-us.bnbchain.org
# - SP endpoints: gnfd-testnet-sp{1-7}.bnbchain.org
# - Faucet: https://gnfd-bsc-faucet.bnbchain.org/

# Greenfield Mainnet
# - Chain ID: 1017
# - RPC: https://greenfield-chain.bnbchain.org
# - SP endpoints: gnfd-sp{1-7}.bnbchain.org

# ===== Getting Started =====
# 1. Create a wallet and get testnet BNB from faucet
# 2. Create a bucket on Greenfield using greenfield-cmd or SDK
# 3. Get the transaction hash from CreateObject operation
# 4. Set the configuration above
# 5. Switch REPUTATION_BACKEND to "greenfield"

# References:
# - Greenfield Docs: https://docs.bnbchain.org/bnb-greenfield/
# - SP API: https://github.com/bnb-chain/greenfield-storage-provider/tree/master/docs/storage-provider-rest-api
